slang PR #2106 (MikePopoloski/slang, open as of 2026-11-09): with the
`range-select-reversed` diagnostic a WARNING (its default), a reversed range
select built a BAD node that every visitor silently skipped, so read_slang
dropped the select from the netlist (YosysHQ/yosys#6464: cva6-rv32 cva6_ptw
co-sim 300 div -> PASS).  Source hunk only; drop this file once the vendored
slang carries the fix.

